WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:53.290
Rock-scissors-paper!

00:01:55.660 --> 00:01:58.390
Someone once said...

00:01:59.190 --> 00:02:02.660
When you face someone with a certain 
pineapple that has two varieties,

00:02:03.530 --> 00:02:09.970
the one that wins rock-scissors-paper 
will produce a bright, ripe fruit...

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:15.480
Rock-Scissors-Pineapple!

00:02:17.810 --> 00:02:22.020
If you're lucky, when you pull on 
one of the tentacles of this octopus

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:32.260
as if you're drawing a lot, it'll 
squirt out beautiful snow...

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:35.130
Lottopus!

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:39.200
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:44.100
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:52.910
In order to obtain the training ingredient, 
Meteor Garlic, Toriko and friends

00:02:52.910 --> 00:02:55.410
are having a showdown with Livebearer,

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:56.980
the boss of the Underground Cooking World,

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:59.550
by playing a concentration-like 
game called Gourmet Tasting.

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:15.700
Toriko defeated the Hanya 
Panda, a joker ingredient.

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:19.340
After smoothly acquiring points,

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:22.240
Toriko's team finally narrowed 
the gap to 410 points.

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:29.050
Coco got a hit with a Super-Special 
Preparation Ingredient, Nitro Cherries.

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:31.750
If he doesn't eat it...

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:32.920
we can't win!

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:35.690
An ingredient that needs 
to be handled with care

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:38.290
since the slightest jostling 
will make it explode...

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:41.160
Here come the Nitro Cherries!

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:43.460
Exploding cherries,

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:45.530
I'm gonna eat you up!

00:03:48.070 --> 00:03:52.700
Climax! The Last, Most Terrible Ingredients!

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:59.810
Only ten minutes remain on the clock 
before the ingredient must be consumed!

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:04.780
Okay...

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:10.890
Six degrees. The temperature at 
which Nitro Cherries are stable.

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:32.740
He needs to detach the 
border between the layers

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:35.180
while maintaining the six degree temperature.

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:38.510
During that time, he can't let it 
absorb even the slightest shock.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:42.180
So that's how you prepare Nitro Cherries...

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:51.190
The border... The space between 
the fruit and the peel...

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:54.460
But the skin is so thin and delicate...

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:58.100
On top of that, it's got this unique form...

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:10.180
30 seconds left to consume the cherries!

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:14.050
Impossible... That's not nearly enough time!

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:17.150
I guess I'll just have to give up once...

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:22.520
Yeah!

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:23.660
Komatsu-kun...

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:25.030
Now it's your turn.

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:29.160
I want to ask you a favor.

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:33.500
I'm assuming you're not 
going to have enough time

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.040
to defuse the Nitro Cherries.

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:37.640
So what I want you to do...

00:05:38.570 --> 00:05:40.040
Coco-san!

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:44.510
There are 15 seconds left! 14, 13...

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:46.910
Outta the way, Komatsu.

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:48.250
Toriko-san!

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:50.220
It's about time to eat.

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:53.420
I give thanks for all this 
world's great bounty...

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:55.020
Time to eat!

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:04.100
Consumed!

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:06.900
Toriko-san!

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:12.270
He really did eat them! What a fool!

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:17.610
That's like shoving lit 
dynamite in your body!

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:21.910
Toriko!

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:23.080
Toriko-san!

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:30.520
Ride it out, Toriko!

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:38.530
That's one damn unlucky ingredient! 
Savor the flavor, Toriko!

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:42.170
Livebearer...

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.340
There's no such thing as lucky or 
unlucky when it comes to ingredients...

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:54.080
Every last one of 'em 
is a blessing of nature!

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:08.660
To me, all ingredients are lucky!

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:11.430
Toriko-san...

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:14.730
With the consumption of the Nitro Cherries,

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:19.440
the Coco-Toriko-Komatsu 
team receives ten points!

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:26.410
His internal organs must've been destroyed 
by the Nitro Cherry explosions,

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:32.080
but Toriko's Gourmet Cells are regenerating 
them at an astounding speed.

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:35.350
Alright. We need to hurry.

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:40.560
They're <i>all</i> lucky?! That's 
a worrisome statement.

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:44.890
Maybe all the ingredients you've 
eaten up to now have been unlucky!

00:07:44.890 --> 00:07:49.830
In that case, I don't think I can expect 
much from your memories, Toriko.

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:57.210
As I suspected, what you've got up 
there is more than enough for me!

00:07:57.840 --> 00:08:02.780
Since Toriko successfully 
ate a joker ingredient,

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:06.720
the Coco-Toriko-Komatsu 
team is allowed to trade

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:09.320
one of their ingredients for one 
of Livebearer-sama's ingredients.

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:15.020
Both sides get the points from the traded 
ingredients if they're eaten, yeah?

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:17.190
I call for a trade.

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:19.560
Yes, certainly.

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:22.760
We'll take your Shock Lemon.

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:25.200
And we're giving you Hanya Panda.

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:26.300
Oh, my.

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:32.270
Surprisingly, in exchange for a 
lucky ingredient worth 200 points,

00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:35.740
the Shock Lemon, Coco traded 
the 250-point Hanya Panda!

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:38.410
Again, instead of dumping 
a ten-point garbage card,

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.750
they offered up a high-point ingredient!

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:46.520
I see. So if Livebearer gives up,

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:50.260
Toriko's team will get Hanya 
Panda's 250 points again.

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:51.830
Is that what they're shooting for?!

00:08:53.460 --> 00:09:01.770
But if Livebearer eats the Hanya 
Panda, then <i>he'll</i> get the 250 points.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:04.700
In that case, it'll be impossible 
for them to catch up.

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:09.580
You really want me to 
give up once, don't you?

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:17.520
But I can see right through 
you. That's not your true aim.

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:20.020
I know what it is.

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:26.090
The food you ultimately 
want to make me eat...

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:29.090
Fools...

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:40.240
You think I can't beat a Hanya Panda?

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:03.290
But I don't need it.

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:04.660
And it's a pain.

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:05.360
What?!

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:13.200
Oh, boy! Livebearer-sama has 
just passed on the Hanya Panda!

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:15.640
That's this game's first give-up!

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:21.180
The Hanya Panda's 250 points go 
to the Coco-Toriko-Komatsu team!

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:26.280
And on to the Shock Lemon! Please eat it!

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:28.450
I'm coating the Shock Lemon

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:33.220
with plenty of this special sauce 
made from a Honey Dragon's honey.

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:35.530
Thank you for the food!

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:49.740
Oh, boy! Even with his damaged 
body,Toriko ate the Shock Lemon,

00:10:49.740 --> 00:10:52.680
which is said to give off 
10,000 volts of electricity!

00:10:52.680 --> 00:10:55.850
The Coco-Toriko-Komatsu 
team receives 200 points...

00:10:55.850 --> 00:10:59.650
...and incredibly, they've 
successfully staged a turnabout!

00:11:06.620 --> 00:11:08.990
Toriko-san, are you okay?!

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:11.130
Komatsu...

00:11:13.260 --> 00:11:18.270
When there's food on my plate, I 
finish it, even if it kills me!

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:43.560
I never thought they'd be able 
to pull off a reversal...

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:52.130
Did he predict that Livebearer would pass?

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:57.300
The Coco-Toriko-Komatsu team got 
three successful hits in a row,

00:11:57.300 --> 00:12:00.270
so the turn goes to Livebearer-sama.

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:05.380
All that's left are unlucky ingredients 
and narcotic ingredients!

00:12:05.380 --> 00:12:07.510
How are they gonna win with that?!

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:14.390
This is the most fun I've ever 
had playing this game. And...

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:17.060
...it's over.

00:12:17.390 --> 00:12:19.530
Numbers 5 and 13.

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:25.230
There it is! A hit with Electric 
Bananas, worth 180 points!

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:28.970
180 points... Don't tell me 
he actually means to eat it...

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:33.940
If he eats that, pretty much all 
that'll be left are crap cards!

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:35.070
This doesn't look good...

00:12:35.070 --> 00:12:41.280
Since Livebearer-sama gave up once, he's 
got to eat this or else he'll lose!

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:44.750
Electric Banana... That 
narcotic ingredient...

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:56.230
He's really gonna eat it?!

00:13:04.140 --> 00:13:07.170
Delicious! Electric Banana cooked in syrup...

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:11.140
I can't get enough! Nummy, nummy!

00:13:11.340 --> 00:13:13.280
Huh? Didn't you know?

00:13:13.280 --> 00:13:17.280
It takes a little work, but if 
you remove the narcotic component

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:21.150
that's terrible for your body, 
you can enjoy it normally!

00:13:22.050 --> 00:13:23.920
So you took out the poison...

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:27.960
I bet you stole that preparation 
process from someone's memories.

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:31.530
Oh, you'd win that bet. And I'm finished!

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:42.870
Livebearer-sama has consumed the ingredient!

00:13:42.870 --> 00:13:48.910
He receives 180 points! Another reversal, 
now with a 130-point difference!

00:13:49.310 --> 00:13:52.620
The points of all the remaining 
cards add up to 80!

00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:54.550
The outcome is clear!

00:14:09.100 --> 00:14:11.530
It's over.

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:14.600
It's impossible for you 
to make a comeback now...

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:18.770
...even if you took all 
of the remaining cards.

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:24.750
I win!

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:27.750
I get to eat...

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:31.450
...that man's memories!

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:35.720
Quickly... I want to slurp them up quickly...

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:38.960
That bastard, gloating over his victory...

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:40.860
It's not over yet, Toriko-san!

00:14:41.300 --> 00:14:43.370
There are still ingredients left!

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:45.030
Let's eat to the end, not 
even leaving one behind!

00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:46.770
Komatsu...

00:14:48.140 --> 00:14:50.140
What did you just say?

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:55.240
He said there are still cards left.

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:56.340
Coco...

00:14:56.340 --> 00:14:59.480
You intend to continue?

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:02.950
Continuing with your turn. 
Hurry up and choose.

00:15:03.350 --> 00:15:05.850
You're saying you can 
still see a chance to win

00:15:05.850 --> 00:15:09.220
among the remaining ingredients?

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:11.390
You're mistaken...

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:16.200
You were mistaken about that 
from the very beginning!

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:18.870
Number 21 and number 27!

00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:21.000
Out! The turn goes to the other side!

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:25.410
I don't need to eat any more ingredients!

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:27.840
You'll eat the rest!

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:34.150
That's <i>if</i> you can eat them...

00:15:41.820 --> 00:15:42.820
I am so...

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:44.790
...thankful.

00:15:45.660 --> 00:15:48.090
Thankful that you behaved just as I planned.

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:52.370
Toriko! Komatsu-kun! One last spurt!

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:53.170
Chug 'em down!

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:54.230
You got it!

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:55.670
Leave it to me!

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:57.400
Rock Lizard!

00:15:57.870 --> 00:16:02.210
The Coco-Toriko-Komatsu team polished 
it off! That's worth 50 points!

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:04.780
Urchin Rat!

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:07.780
Done! Ten points added to the tally!

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:09.720
Scissor Snake!

00:16:09.720 --> 00:16:12.150
Consumed! That's another ten points!

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:14.450
Thank you for the food!

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:16.590
My wounds...

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:19.220
After successfully eating 
three ingredients in a row,

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:22.860
the Coco-Toriko-Komatsu team 
has a total of 1,360 points!

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:26.630
They trail Livebearer-sama by 60 points!

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:33.000
All that's left is one pair of ingredients.

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:37.740
The turn goes to Livebearer-sama!

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:39.210
I figured as much.

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:46.420
That's the unlucky ingredient 
you're dying to get me to eat...

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:48.550
Poison Potato!

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:54.360
True, it is a terrible, 
terrible unlucky ingredient.

00:16:54.360 --> 00:17:00.760
Perhaps in a normal scenario, I'd say, 
"I give up!" and you'd say, "We win!"

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:05.500
But I've got unfortunate news for you.

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:10.910
Your thinking has been 
flawed from the beginning.

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:18.850
There isn't a single ingredient here 
at the Gourmet Casino that I can't eat.

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:24.820
No matter how special the ingredient is...

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:29.960
No matter how powerful the Beast is...

00:17:31.130 --> 00:17:37.800
The methods of capturing and cooking 
all of them are stored in my noggin.

00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:39.500
Do you understand?

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:43.970
You've been fighting a losing 
battle right from the start.

00:17:43.970 --> 00:17:46.740
We've been played... The scumbag...

00:17:46.740 --> 00:17:52.680
But even so, Coco, your 
cool-headed judgment...

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:55.420
Toriko, your astonishing appetite...

00:17:55.420 --> 00:18:00.160
And that chef and his unparalleled talent...

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:04.030
Honestly, even though you're my 
enemies, I admire all of you.

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:09.000
You can relax.

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:12.830
Even when your brain is cleaned 
out, it's not like you'll die.

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:20.140
In fact, I can imagine how cute an 
empty-headed Toriko-chan is going to be.

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:23.880
So cute I'd agree to partner up with you.

00:18:24.110 --> 00:18:26.980
Memories are our lives...

00:18:27.780 --> 00:18:30.880
Hence, erasing memories...

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:34.920
That's equivalent to stealing 
that person's life!

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:37.520
Now that's true victory!

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:39.790
That's supreme bliss!

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:43.160
Truly, for me...

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:46.200
...there's nothing more pleasurable!

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:52.240
I knew that.

00:18:53.910 --> 00:18:59.610
Right from the start, I knew that you 
could eat all of the ingredients.

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:01.350
Oh. Is that right?

00:19:01.810 --> 00:19:04.020
It's obvious that a jerk who 
has no qualms about cheating

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:08.920
wouldn't bother putting ingredients 
he couldn't eat into the game.

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:12.460
You knew it, but still thought 
you had a chance of winning?

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:15.730
The methods of cooking Special 
Preparation Ingredients...

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:19.060
I assume you stole those techniques 
from other people's brains as well.

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:21.770
Even though you remember how to eat them...

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:30.440
...you don't remember the order in which 
you ate the ingredients today, do you?

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:35.080
The order... in which I ate them?

00:19:35.710 --> 00:19:37.720
You know how to eat it, right?

00:19:37.720 --> 00:19:39.980
Then hurry up and eat it.

00:19:39.980 --> 00:19:41.720
The final ingredient...

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:46.990
However... it'll be the 
last one you ever eat.

00:20:02.270 --> 00:20:03.440
It can't be...

00:20:16.620 --> 00:20:19.220
In those younger days,

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:21.120
No matter how you chased them,

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:25.730
The sky-spanning rainbows got away

00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:29.030
After that, time passed

00:20:29.030 --> 00:20:31.500
Were you able to grasp

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:36.140
The rainbow by the name of dreams then?

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:39.840
When it comes to a new challenge,

00:20:41.480 --> 00:20:45.110
You turn into a coward,

00:20:46.380 --> 00:20:50.550
But your chance ain't gonna wait on you,

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:55.420
So now's the time!

00:20:57.390 --> 00:21:03.100
Bet those tears and that kindness

00:21:03.100 --> 00:21:07.370
Will light up tomorrow

00:21:07.670 --> 00:21:10.440
That's right, rainbows are 
all the more beautiful

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:14.240
Because we can't catch 'em

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:18.050
Today's Gourmet Tasting Lecture!

00:21:18.580 --> 00:21:20.180
I'm your newscaster, Tina.

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:22.250
We're about to reach the climax of the game!

00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:25.020
But first, let's take a detailed look

00:21:25.020 --> 00:21:28.760
at the flow of today's 
game and its checkpoints!

00:21:30.090 --> 00:21:31.790
Still, though, is it really 
okay to have an announcer there

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:34.400
who's got a heaping helping of bias?

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:38.030
He even says <i>sama</i> after Livebearer...

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:39.770
He should treat all the players equally...

00:21:40.630 --> 00:21:42.100
Pardon me!

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:47.470
Toriko consumed the Nitro Cherries 
and they went up to 840 points!

00:21:47.840 --> 00:21:50.480
The Nitro Cherries were a joker ingredient,

00:21:51.110 --> 00:21:53.910
so they were able to trade 
Hanya Panda for Shock Lemon!

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:56.950
Livebearer gave up on it, though,

00:21:56.950 --> 00:22:00.150
so the Coco-Toriko-Komatsu 
team received points for both!

00:22:01.450 --> 00:22:03.120
They suddenly pulled ahead!

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:04.220
However!

00:22:04.990 --> 00:22:11.900
Livebearer ate an Electric Banana, taking 
the lead once more, 130 points ahead!

00:22:11.900 --> 00:22:16.070
The total of all the points of the 
remaining cards only added up to 80!

00:22:16.070 --> 00:22:17.400
It looked like this was the end...

00:22:17.840 --> 00:22:23.440
...but for some reason, the 
Coco-Toriko-Komatsu team kept going!

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:27.180
Toriko ate a Rock Lizard, 
Urchin Rat, and Scissor Snake.

00:22:27.810 --> 00:22:31.020
But they were fighting in vain, as 
their points didn't go far enough.

00:22:31.020 --> 00:22:33.350
Then the turn went to Livebearer!

00:22:33.350 --> 00:22:35.650
There's only one ingredient left!

00:22:36.050 --> 00:22:38.420
And that brings us to today's cool point!

00:22:41.530 --> 00:22:44.100
The order of eating will 
be the deciding factor!

00:22:46.200 --> 00:22:49.530
Like it or not, the right or wrong 
timing of eating this final ingredient,

00:22:49.530 --> 00:22:55.370
the extremely poisonous Poison 
Potato, will determine who wins!

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:00.850
So in the end, who will be 
victorious with this game?!

00:23:02.510 --> 00:23:04.580
And now, on to the next segment!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:08.550
The game approaches it's climax.

00:23:08.960 --> 00:23:13.460
Choosing the courageous strategy will be the point that decides who wins!

00:23:13.770 --> 00:23:16.890
The Moment of Truth! Coco's Daring Scenario!

00:23:16.890 --> 00:23:18.970
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
